          "source_id": "s-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete-ws1501803",
          "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete:p014",
          "quote": "　　遷中書郎，領東觀祭酒。兄季，爲上虞令，卒。愿從省步還家，不待詔便歸東。除驍騎將軍，遷廷尉，祭酒如故。愿嘗事宋明帝，齊初宋神主遷汝陰廟，愿拜辭流涕。建元元年，卒。年五十四。愿著《五經論問》，撰《會稽記》，文翰數十篇。",
          "subject_person_mention_id": "c-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete:p014:m0023",
          "object_person_mention_id": "c-nanqishu-053-local-officials-complete:p014:m0014"
        }
      ],
      "status": "source_attested",
      "interpretation_note": "兄為上虞令。",
